From 6b09f7b4cf8491fa104b443ee2311026e6c7e5b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bezko <bezkom@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 03:35:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Toggle aux send mute via Processor activate.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Alt+click the mixer send track mutes/unmutes the Aux InternalSend
(deactivate/activate). Dim fill + Sm badge when muted. --smoke-send-mute
asserts mute↔unmute round-trip on Dummy.
---
 win_ardour/engine_host.cc  | 116 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 win_ardour/engine_host.h   |   8 +++
 win_ardour/main.cc         |   5 +-
 win_ardour/mixer_strip.cc  |   8 ++-
 win_ardour/mixer_strip.h   |   3 +
 win_ardour/shell_window.cc |  26 +++++++++
 win_ardour/shell_window.h  |   1 +
 7 files changed, 164 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/win_ardour/engine_host.cc b/win_ardour/engine_host.cc
index 199e78c5406..1e89f7c8497 100644
--- a/win_ardour/engine_host.cc
+++ b/win_ardour/engine_host.cc
@@ -598,6 +598,7 @@ EngineHost::EngineHost ()
